#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"This plugin can be used for all types of sports where 2 or 4 players compete in singles or doubles.\n"
"You can use this plugin for tennis, table tennis, squash, padel, badminton, beach volleyball and probably for more."
msgstr ""
"Dette plugin kan bruges til alle sportsgrene, hvor 2 eller 4 spillere dyster i single eller double.\n"
"Du kan bruge det til tennis, bordtennis, squash, padel, badminton, beachvolley og sikkert mere."

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "Yes. When creating a tournament, you can choose whether to create a singles or a doubles tournament."
msgstr "Ja. Når du opretter en turnering, kan du vælge, om det skal være en single- eller doubleturnering."

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "What sports tournaments is this plugin for?"
msgstr "Hvilke sportsturneringer er dette plugin beregnet til?"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "<strong>General Features:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Generelle funktioner:</strong>"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "<strong>Doubles Rotation Tournament:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Double-rotationsturnering:</strong>"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "<strong>Singles Rotation Tournament:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Single-rotationsturnering:</strong>"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The participants of a tournament change partners several times during the tournament by a random selection and play against different players. The ratio of games won to games lost is calculated for each participant. The winner of the tournament is the player with this highest ratio. While a Singles Rotation Tournament can be organized without the aid of technology, in the case of a Doubles Rotation Tournament, this is not possible."
msgstr "Deltagerne i en turnering skifter makker flere gange i løbet af turneringen ved tilfældig udvælgelse og spiller mod forskellige spillere. For hver deltager beregnes forholdet mellem vundne og tabte partier. Turneringens vinder er spilleren med det højeste forhold. En single-rotationsturnering kan arrangeres uden hjælp fra teknik, men det er ikke muligt ved en double-rotationsturnering."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The <strong>Rotation Tournaments</strong> have a strong social aspect because its goal is to keep players in the tournament until the very end. The situation where weaker players would leave the tournament due to elimination rounds is eliminated. It allows grouping players into a special category with special conditions. This special setting can be utilized, for example, in mixed tournaments."
msgstr "<strong>Rotationsturneringer</strong> har en stærk social side, fordi målet er at holde spillerne i turneringen helt til slut. Situationen, hvor svagere spillere forlader turneringen på grund af udslagsrunder, undgås. Spillere kan samles i en særlig kategori med særlige betingelser. Denne særlige indstilling kan f.eks. bruges i mixturneringer."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "In <strong>Rotation Tournaments</strong>, each participant plays against every other participant and there are no eliminations in individual rounds. To maximize the variety of match combinations, the matches are typically played in a single set."
msgstr "I <strong>rotationsturneringer</strong> spiller hver deltager mod alle andre, og ingen slås ud i de enkelte runder. For at få flest mulige kampkombinationer spilles kampene normalt i ét sæt."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Suitable for various sports: tennis, table tennis, squash, padel, badminton, beach volleyball, and more."
msgstr "Velegnet til forskellige sportsgrene: tennis, bordtennis, squash, padel, badminton, beachvolley og mere."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Integration with website user accounts."
msgstr "Integration med webstedets brugerkonti."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "No downtime during the tournament."
msgstr "Ingen ventetid under turneringen."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Comprehensive overview of player quality."
msgstr "Fuldt overblik over spillernes niveau."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "User-friendly interface for administrators and participants."
msgstr "Brugervenlig grænseflade for administratorer og deltagere."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Customizable settings for each tournament."
msgstr "Tilpasselige indstillinger for hver turnering."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Real-time score tracking."
msgstr "Resultatsporing i realtid."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Seamless scheduling of matches."
msgstr "Problemfri planlægning af kampe."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Announcement of the Best Player and Most Ideal Pair at the end of the tournament."
msgstr "Kåring af bedste spiller og mest ideelle par ved turneringens slutning."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Ranking based on the ratio of games won to games lost."
msgstr "Placering ud fra forholdet mellem vundne og tabte partier."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Individual players can join or leave the tournament at any time."
msgstr "Spillere kan til enhver tid deltage i eller forlade turneringen."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Tournament can be interrupted or extended without disruption."
msgstr "Turneringen kan afbrydes eller forlænges uden forstyrrelse."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Shorter matches for more participation."
msgstr "Kortere kampe giver plads til flere deltagere."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "No eliminations, ensuring all players stay in the game."
msgstr "Ingen udslagning – alle spillere forbliver i spillet."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Define special groups of players with unique conditions."
msgstr "Definér særlige grupper af spillere med egne betingelser."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Suitable for odd numbers of players and minimum lineups of 4 players."
msgstr "Velegnet til et ulige antal spillere og et minimum på 4 spillere."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Individuals can enter the tournament without a permanent teammate."
msgstr "Man kan deltage i turneringen uden fast makker."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Rotation of teammates, ensuring variety in partnerships."
msgstr "Skiftende makkere giver variation i parrene."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Alternative form of a Doubles Tournament where players enter each match with a different partner and in different positions (alternating left and right sides)."
msgstr "Alternativ form for doubleturnering, hvor spillerne spiller hver kamp med en ny makker og på nye positioner (skiftevis venstre og højre side)."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Depending on the time options, everyone plays against everyone."
msgstr "Afhængigt af den tilgængelige tid spiller alle mod alle."

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Alternative form of a Singles Tournament where players face each other without elimination rounds."
msgstr "Alternativ form for singleturnering, hvor spillerne møder hinanden uden udslagsrunder."

#. Found in description header.
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Funktioner"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Is this plugin suitable for singles tournaments?"
msgstr "Er dette plugin velegnet til singleturneringer?"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "Yes, each tournament participant must have their own account. If a website has disabled user registration, this account must be created by the website administrator."
msgstr "Ja, hver deltager i turneringen skal have sin egen konto. Hvis et websted har slået brugerregistrering fra, skal kontoen oprettes af webstedsadministratoren."

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Does each player have to have an account created on my website?"
msgstr "Skal hver spiller have en konto på mit websted?"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "At the end close the tournament and look who was announced as the winner."
msgstr "Til sidst lukker du turneringen og ser, hvem der er kåret som vinder."

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "You can change tournament settings on the main page or you can look at 2 new admin pages that are dedicated for overall environmental settings and for description of all possible shortcodes."
msgstr "Du kan ændre turneringens indstillinger på hovedsiden eller se på 2 nye administrationssider til de generelle miljøindstillinger og beskrivelsen af alle tilgængelige shortcodes."

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "If you have a sufficient amount of players then you can close a registration and start playing matches."
msgstr "Hvis du har nok spillere, kan du lukke tilmeldingen og begynde at spille kampe."

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Then you can log in your created tournament and as a tournament´s administrator you can add manually also other players sourced from WP database."
msgstr "Derefter kan du tilmelde dig den oprettede turnering og som turneringsadministrator manuelt tilføje andre spillere fra WordPress-databasen."

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Start by clicking on \"Create a new tournament\" under \"Tournament Selection …\" on the main page."
msgstr "Start med at klikke på \"Opret en ny turnering\" under \"Valg af turnering…\" på hovedsiden."

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Install the plugin as usual."
msgstr "Installér pluginet som sædvanligt."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Visit <a href=\"https://doroto.ltcchrast.cz/\">test page</a> for more information, try to create your own tournament and take a look at <a href=\"https://doroto.ltcchrast.cz/rules-of-the-doubles-rotation-tournament/\">Rules of the Doubles Rotation Tournament</a>."
msgstr "Besøg <a href=\"https://doroto.ltcchrast.cz/\">testsiden</a> for flere oplysninger, prøv at oprette din egen turnering, og se <a href=\"https://doroto.ltcchrast.cz/rules-of-the-doubles-rotation-tournament/\">reglerne for double-rotationsturneringen</a>."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "[youtube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NoL9aPTv8u8]"
msgstr "[youtube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NoL9aPTv8u8]"

#. Found in description header.
msgid "More information"
msgstr "Flere oplysninger"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - the plugin restores read permissions of its files after an FTP upload (the web server answered 403 and the admin page stayed empty); the admin page shows a notice when its script cannot be loaded"
msgstr "Rettelse – pluginet gendanner læserettighederne for sine filer efter en FTP-upload (webserveren svarede 403, og administrationssiden forblev tom); administrationssiden viser en meddelelse, når dens script ikke kan indlæses"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - tournament settings keep the ranges of 1.x and of the app (a larger value made the app's dropdowns fail)"
msgstr "Rettelse – turneringens indstillinger bevarer intervallerne fra 1.x og appen (en større værdi fik appens rullelister til at fejle)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improvement - REST requests from the website use the WordPress login (cookie and nonce) when no app token is sent"
msgstr "Forbedring – REST-forespørgsler fra webstedet bruger WordPress-login (cookie og nonce), når der ikke sendes et app-token"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improvement - styles, scripts and no-cache headers are sent only on pages that show the plugin; the unused tipTip library was removed and the admin no longer calls ip-api.com"
msgstr "Forbedring – styles, scripts og no-cache-headere sendes kun på sider, der viser pluginet; det ubrugte bibliotek tipTip er fjernet, og administrationen kalder ikke længere ip-api.com"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improvement - every change of a tournament (web forms, blocks and the Android app) goes through one shared layer with the same permissions, locking and change detection"
msgstr "Forbedring – hver ændring af en turnering (webformularer, blokke og Android-appen) går gennem ét fælles lag med samme rettigheder, låsning og ændringsregistrering"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improvement - new admin page with Overview, Settings and Help instead of nine settings tabs; every setting is checked on the server and errors are shown next to the field"
msgstr "Forbedring – ny administrationsside med Oversigt, Indstillinger og Hjælp i stedet for ni indstillingsfaner; hver indstilling kontrolleres på serveren, og fejl vises ved feltet"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - the serving player is marked on the match cards; the special group is highlighted in matches, results, players, statistics and winners; the tournament details (invitation text) can be shown at any time"
msgstr "Tilføjet – den servende spiller er markeret på kampkortene; den særlige gruppe fremhæves i kampe, resultater, spillere, statistik og vindere; turneringsdetaljerne (invitationsteksten) kan vises når som helst"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - the tournament block takes its colours from the theme (button and palette colours); the block's Styles panel can change the accent, the tab bar and table headers, their text and the colour of the special group"
msgstr "Tilføjet – turneringsblokken henter sine farver fra temaet (knap- og paletfarver); blokkens panel Stilarter kan ændre accent, fanebjælke og tabeloverskrifter, deres tekst og den særlige gruppes farve"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - the tournament block: Share dialog with a QR code, \"Open in the app\" line, full-screen presentation that rotates the sections, map of the tournament place in the settings, and guided tours of the page and of four example tournaments"
msgstr "Tilføjet – turneringsblokken: dialogen Del med QR-kode, linjen \"Åbn i appen\", fuldskærmspræsentation, der skifter mellem sektionerne, kort over turneringens sted i indstillingerne og guidede ture gennem siden og fire eksempelturneringer"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - the plugin admin can convert the main page to the blocks with one button; the old content stays in the page revisions. New installs create the main page from the blocks. The shortcodes [doroto_tournament] and [doroto_tournament_list] show the blocks in the classic editor; the 1.x shortcodes keep working"
msgstr "Tilføjet – pluginadministratoren kan konvertere hovedsiden til blokke med én knap; det gamle indhold bliver i sidens revisioner. Nye installationer opretter hovedsiden med blokkene. Shortcodes [doroto_tournament] og [doroto_tournament_list] viser blokkene i den klassiske editor; shortcodes fra 1.x virker fortsat"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - blocks for the block editor: \"Rotation tournament\" (matches, results, players, statistics and settings on tabs, updated live without reloading the page), its variations \"Tournament standings\", \"Tournament matches\" and \"Tournament presentation\", \"Tournament list\" and \"Tournament invitation\""
msgstr "Tilføjet – blokke til blokeditoren: \"Rotationsturnering\" (kampe, resultater, spillere, statistik og indstillinger i faner, opdateret live uden genindlæsning af siden), dens varianter \"Turneringens stilling\", \"Turneringens kampe\" og \"Turneringspræsentation\", \"Turneringsliste\" og \"Turneringsinvitation\""

#. Found in changelog header.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "2.0.0 - 2026/10/06"
msgstr "2.0.0 - 2026/10/06"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Change - the review request is shown only to administrators, 14 days after activation once the site has its own tournament, and comes back 7 days after \"Remind me\" until the plugin is rated"
msgstr "Ændring – anmodningen om bedømmelse vises kun for administratorer, 14 dage efter aktivering, når webstedet har sin egen turnering, og vender tilbage 7 dage efter \"Påmind mig\", indtil pluginet er bedømt"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - the tournament page shows a short link to the Android app (can be turned off in Settings -&gt; Mobile app)"
msgstr "Tilføjet – turneringssiden viser et kort link til Android-appen (kan slås fra under Indstillinger -&gt; Mobilapp)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - optional mode join/leave for the app join endpoint"
msgstr "Tilføjet – valgfri tilstand deltag/forlad for appens deltagelses-endpoint"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - REST endpoint create-player: the organizer creates a player and adds them to the tournament in one step; the player gets an e-mail to set the password"
msgstr "Tilføjet – REST-endpoint create-player: arrangøren opretter en spiller og tilføjer vedkommende til turneringen i ét trin; spilleren får en e-mail til at vælge adgangskode"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Change - tournament links to the home page (\"?tournament_id=5\") and the old app QR codes (\"/tournament?id=5\") open the tournament page"
msgstr "Ændring – turneringslinks til forsiden (\"?tournament_id=5\") og appens gamle QR-koder (\"/tournament?id=5\") åbner turneringssiden"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Change - the default name of a new tournament uses the site time zone, not UTC"
msgstr "Ændring – standardnavnet på en ny turnering bruger webstedets tidszone, ikke UTC"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Change - the app can be signed in on several devices at once (up to 10 per user)"
msgstr "Ændring – appen kan være logget ind på flere enheder samtidig (op til 10 pr. bruger)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Change - invitation link only joins the tournament (a second click no longer unregisters the player), redirects to the login page and back, and then to the tournament page"
msgstr "Ændring – invitationslinket tilmelder kun til turneringen (et andet klik afmelder ikke længere spilleren), sender videre til login-siden og tilbage og derefter til turneringssiden"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - REST responses are never served from page caches or CDNs"
msgstr "Rettelse – REST-svar leveres aldrig fra sidecache eller CDN"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Authorization header is read also on FPM/CGI hosts"
msgstr "Rettelse – Authorization-headeren læses også på FPM/CGI-hosts"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - database upgrade adds new columns also on already installed sites"
msgstr "Rettelse – databaseopgraderingen tilføjer nye kolonner også på allerede installerede websteder"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - several devices signing in or refreshing their session at the same moment no longer sign each other out"
msgstr "Rettelse – flere enheder, der logger ind eller fornyer deres session samtidig, logger ikke længere hinanden ud"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - every change of a running tournament (correcting a result, suspending or removing a player, settings, payments, special group, web forms) runs under the tournament lock; correcting a result while another court saved its result could stall the whole tournament"
msgstr "Rettelse – hver ændring af en igangværende turnering (rettelse af et resultat, pause eller fjernelse af en spiller, indstillinger, betalinger, særlig gruppe, webformularer) sker under turneringslåsen; rettelse af et resultat, mens en anden bane gemte sit resultat, kunne låse hele turneringen"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - tournament lock: results entered at the same time on several courts are no longer lost"
msgstr "Rettelse – turneringslås: resultater indtastet samtidig på flere baner går ikke længere tabt"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - every write to a tournament updates last_update"
msgstr "Rettelse – hver skrivning til en turnering opdaterer last_update"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - results entered on the web no longer store last_update = 0, so the Android app refreshes again"
msgstr "Rettelse – resultater indtastet på webstedet gemmer ikke længere last_update = 0, så Android-appen opdaterer igen"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security - with registration disabled only tournament organizers can create player accounts from the app (before, any signed-in player could)"
msgstr "Sikkerhed – når registrering er slået fra, kan kun turneringsarrangører oprette spillerkonti fra appen (før kunne enhver indlogget spiller)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security - an account created by an organizer no longer returns a login session of the new player to the organizer"
msgstr "Sikkerhed – en konto oprettet af en arrangør returnerer ikke længere den nye spillers loginsession til arrangøren"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security - registration from the app (incl. a new Google account) respects \"Anyone can register\""
msgstr "Sikkerhed – registrering fra appen (inkl. en ny Google-konto) respekterer \"Alle kan registrere sig\""

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security - final doubles and registration toggle check tournament admin rights"
msgstr "Sikkerhed – finaledouble og skift af tilmelding kontrollerer turneringens administratorrettigheder"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security - guided tour actions need a nonce; regenerating the example tournaments is throttled"
msgstr "Sikkerhed – handlinger i den guidede tur kræver en nonce; genoprettelse af eksempelturneringerne er begrænset"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security - admin actions sent as links are protected by a nonce (CSRF)"
msgstr "Sikkerhed – administrationshandlinger sendt som links er beskyttet af en nonce (CSRF)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security - front-end forms check tournament admin rights, not only the nonce (any logged-in user could change players, payments or delete a tournament)"
msgstr "Sikkerhed – formularer på webstedet kontrollerer turneringens administratorrettigheder, ikke kun noncen (enhver indlogget bruger kunne ændre spillere, betalinger eller slette en turnering)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - app tournament links on the central site (?tournament_id=5&amp;doroto_site=) are forwarded to the club's tournament page when the app is not installed (sites from the site directory; other sites get a page with a link)"
msgstr "Tilføjet – appens turneringslinks på det centrale websted (?tournament_id=5&amp;doroto_site=) sendes videre til klubbens turneringsside, når appen ikke er installeret (websteder fra webstedsoversigten; andre websteder får en side med et link)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - the tournament page has an \"Open in the app\" link: Android opens the tournament in the app, or Google Play when it is missing"
msgstr "Tilføjet – turneringssiden har linket \"Åbn i appen\": Android åbner turneringen i appen eller Google Play, hvis den mangler"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - saving the tournament settings rejects an unknown tournament type"
msgstr "Rettelse – når turneringens indstillinger gemmes, afvises en ukendt turneringstype"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - a deleted account leaves its open tournaments: removed when it has not played yet, otherwise suspended; it also leaves the organizers, special group and payments (it was drawn into matches as \"Unknown player\")"
msgstr "Rettelse – en slettet konto forlader sine åbne turneringer: fjernes, hvis den ikke har spillet endnu, ellers sættes den på pause; den forlader også arrangørerne, den særlige gruppe og betalingerne (den blev udtrukket til kampe som \"Ukendt spiller\")"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - removing a payment no longer turns the payment list into a JSON object (the Android app could crash on the statistics page)"
msgstr "Rettelse – fjernelse af en betaling gør ikke længere betalingslisten til et JSON-objekt (Android-appen kunne gå ned på statistiksiden)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - the change form fits on a phone screen (the result and the button were off screen)"
msgstr "Rettelse – ændringsformularen passer til en telefonskærm (resultatet og knappen var uden for skærmen)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - organizers see an \"Edit result\" button next to every played match; it selects the match and its result in the change form (the form above the table was easy to miss)"
msgstr "Tilføjet – arrangører ser en knap \"Rediger resultat\" ved hver spillet kamp; den vælger kampen og dens resultat i ændringsformularen (formularen over tabellen blev let overset)"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - REST route skip-matches: the organizer skips several ongoing matches at once and new matches are drawn from all free players"
msgstr "Tilføjet – REST-rute skip-matches: arrangøren springer flere igangværende kampe over på én gang, og nye kampe udtrækkes blandt alle ledige spillere"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improvement - among players with the same number of new teammates left, the one who played fewer games is drawn first; sides (left/right) alternate for both players of a team"
msgstr "Forbedring – blandt spillere med lige mange resterende nye makkere udtrækkes den, der har spillet færrest partier, først; siderne (venstre/højre) skifter for begge spillere på et hold"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improvement - the draw chooses the opposing team (and the teammate) by previous meetings too: players meet more different opponents and the same players meet less often (with 14 players on 2 courts, pairs that met 3 or more times dropped from about 5 to 1 per evening)"
msgstr "Forbedring – udtrækningen vælger modstanderholdet (og makkeren) også ud fra tidligere møder: spillerne møder flere forskellige modstandere, og de samme spillere mødes sjældnere (med 14 spillere på 2 baner faldt antallet af par, der mødtes 3 gange eller flere, fra ca. 5 til 1 pr. aften)"

