#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Fixed a bug in the database that prevented a tournament record from being created on some servers."
msgstr "Rettelse – en databasefejl, der på nogle servere forhindrede oprettelse af en turneringspost, er rettet."

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Unregistered users can no longer enter results in the singles tournament."
msgstr "Rettelse – ikke-registrerede brugere kan ikke længere indtaste resultater i singleturneringen."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Possibility to remove players from an already ongoing tournament."
msgstr "Mulighed for at fjerne spillere fra en allerede igangværende turnering."

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "New - Expanded the ability for tournament administrators to browse through players they have already met at the tournament."
msgstr "Nyhed – turneringsadministratorer kan gennemse flere spillere, de allerede har mødt til en turnering."

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "New - If the player has not yet registered for any tournament, it is possible to choose whether to show him a quick help."
msgstr "Nyhed – hvis spilleren endnu ikke har tilmeldt sig en turnering, kan man vælge, om der skal vises en hurtig hjælp."

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "New - Optional login prompt."
msgstr "Nyhed – valgfri opfordring til at logge ind."

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - If all tournaments were deleted, a new tournament could not be created."
msgstr "Rettelse – hvis alle turneringer var slettet, kunne der ikke oprettes en ny turnering."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Trial tournament improvements.\n"
"Added the option to announce the end of the tournament round."
msgstr ""
"Forbedringer af prøveturneringen.\n"
"Mulighed for at annoncere turneringsrundens slutning tilføjet."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Improved the visual appearance of the main page.\n"
"Badminton added to the list of available tournaments."
msgstr ""
"Hovedsidens udseende forbedret.\n"
"Badminton tilføjet til listen over tilgængelige turneringer."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Option to announce separate winners from the special group and outside the special group."
msgstr "Mulighed for at kåre separate vindere fra den særlige gruppe og uden for den særlige gruppe."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Notices after a plugin activation.\n"
"Added player trend."
msgstr ""
"Meddelelser efter aktivering af pluginet.\n"
"Spillertrend tilføjet."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Modified tournament editing tab.\n"
"Added option to change tournament type."
msgstr ""
"Fanen til redigering af turnering ændret.\n"
"Mulighed for at ændre turneringstype tilføjet."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Reactivating the plugin doesn´t affect the already deleted tournament example. \n"
"Unblock offering maximum games count.\n"
"Fix tournament change when entering results.\n"
"Added quick help for newcomers.\n"
"Allow the final match also for singles."
msgstr ""
"Genaktivering af pluginet påvirker ikke den allerede slettede eksempelturnering.\n"
"Valget af maksimalt antal partier er låst op.\n"
"Rettelse af skift af turnering ved indtastning af resultater.\n"
"Hurtig hjælp til nybegyndere tilføjet.\n"
"Finalekamp tilladt også i single."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Added the option for single tournaments. \n"
"Created an environment for additional sports."
msgstr ""
"Mulighed for singleturneringer tilføjet.\n"
"Miljø til andre sportsgrene oprettet."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"The administrator can now use 'hide' option when editing the match result.\n"
"Free score input is allowed. This opens using not only for tennis but for example for table tennis or beach volleyball."
msgstr ""
"Administratoren kan nu bruge muligheden \"skjul\" ved redigering af kampresultatet.\n"
"Fri indtastning af score er tilladt. Det gør pluginet brugbart ikke kun til tennis, men f.eks. også til bordtennis eller beachvolley."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Minor changes in code:\n"
"* Allow to transfer organizer rights to a non-playing user.\n"
"* Ensuring an even rotation of serves at the start of the tournament."
msgstr ""
"Mindre ændringer i koden:\n"
"* Arrangørrettigheder kan overdrages til en ikke-spillende bruger.\n"
"* Jævnt skift af serven ved turneringens start."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fixed choosing between left and right side in first matches."
msgstr "Valget mellem venstre og højre side i de første kampe er rettet."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "A small modification of admin screen."
msgstr "En lille ændring af administrationsskærmen."

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "First release to public."
msgstr "Første offentlige udgivelse."

